---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h1>Privacy Policy for OnlineJobsReveiws.co.ke</h1>
    <p>At OnlineJobsReveiws.co.ke, accessible from https://onlinejobsreveiws.co.ke, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and recorded by OnlineJobsReveiws.co.ke and how we use it.</p>
    
    <h2>Log Files</h2>
    <p>OnlineJobsReveiws.co.ke follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks.</p>
    
    <h2>Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
    <p>Like any other website, OnlineJobsReveiws.co.ke uses 'cookies'. These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited.</p>
    
    <h2>GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
    <p>We would like to make sure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Every user is entitled to the following: The right to access, the right to rectification, the right to erasure, the right to restrict processing, the right to object to processing, and the right to data portability.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>